      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-24T16:54:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My assumption was that it was the responsibility of the next-stage bootloader, but I\u0027m not sure. Maybe Ard can comment?",
      "parentUuid": "cac0c58f_db744676",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 41,
